  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "Slice onions and mince garlic. Mince gochugaru.",
    "Heat olive oil in a tagine pot. Add lardons, cook until golden.",
    "Add minced garlic and gochugaru, stir for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in sliced onions and thyme leaves. Cook until slightly translucent.",
    "Core red bell peppers and zucchini, add to the mix. Cover with a lid and reduce heat to 160°C (320°F).",
    "Bake for about 45 minutes or until vegetables are tender.",
    "Sprinkle basil on top before serving."
